    {
      "style": "callout",
      "pos": [
        1440,
        290
      ],
      "w": 340,
      "text": "ENTRYPOINT is the coffee machine: it always runs.\nCMD is the cup size: a default you can change.\n\nTo change the machine itself, you have to ask for it with --entrypoint."
